 f8-b4+** is the strongest move because:\n- It gives check, forcing White to respond immediately\n- White's king hasn't moved (KWF0) and this disrupts any castling plans\n- It develops my bishop with tempo\n- White must either move the king (losing castling rights) or block with a piece\n- After White responds, I can continue developing while maintaining initiative\n- It's a concrete forcing move that improves my position\n\nAnswer: B: f8-b4"}
