re\n- Controls critical squares (d6, f6, c7, d4) that restrict White's king\n- Supports my king's advance to d5 or f5 next move\n- Maintains flexibility for my pawn breaks\n- The bishop from e5 can support both queenside and kingside pawn advances\n\nAnswer: B: d4-e5"}
