ate checkmate. The White King on a5 is trapped with no legal moves - all adjacent squares (a6, a4, b6, b5, b4) are either occupied by the Queen or controlled by my pieces. This is a forced checkmate in one move.\n\nAnswer: Q: c4-a4"}
